.Dd November 5, 2026
.Dt MACCHIATO 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm macchiato
.Nd keep your Mac awake with an animated coffee cup
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Ar caffeinate options
.Op Ar utility Op Ar argument ...
.Nm
.Fl \-version | \-help
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is a thin wrapper around
.Xr caffeinate 8 .
Every argument is passed to
.Nm caffeinate
unchanged, and
.Nm caffeinate
alone decides how the Mac stays awake.
.Pp
While
.Nm caffeinate
runs, an animated coffee cup is drawn on standard error.
The cup is scaled to fit the terminal and redrawn when the window is resized.
Typed input is not echoed while the cup is drawn.
When
.Nm
exits, the drawing is erased and the terminal is restored.
.Pp
Nothing is drawn, and
.Nm caffeinate
replaces the
.Nm
process, when any of these hold:
.Bl -bullet -compact
.It
standard error is not a terminal;
.It
.Ev TERM
is unset or
.Dq dumb ;
.It
.Ev MACCHIATO_NO_ANIMATION
is set;
.It
the arguments name a utility for
.Nm caffeinate
to run, such as
.Ql macchiato -i make .
.El
.Pp
.Fl \-version
and
.Fl \-help
are recognized only as the single argument.
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width "MACCHIATO_NO_ANIMATION"
.It Ev MACCHIATO_NO_ANIMATION
If set to a non-empty value, never draw; run
.Nm caffeinate
directly.
.It Ev NO_COLOR
If set to a non-empty value, show the status text without colors and without the cup.
.It Ev COLORTERM
If
.Dq truecolor
or
.Dq 24bit ,
draw with 24-bit colors.
Otherwise the 256-color palette is used.
.It Ev TERM
If unset or
.Dq dumb ,
nothing is drawn.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Nm
exits with the status of
.Nm caffeinate .
When interrupted, terminated, or hung up, it stops
.Nm caffeinate ,
restores the terminal, and terminates from the same signal.
.Sh EXAMPLES
Stay awake until
.Ql Ctrl+C :
.Dl $ macchiato
.Pp
Keep the display awake for 30 minutes:
.Dl $ macchiato -d -t 1800
.Pp
Stay awake while a build runs, without the cup:
.Dl $ macchiato -i make
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr pmset 1 ,
.Xr caffeinate 8
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Mauro Cicerchia
